{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":50,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的罪惡"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華說：",{"text":"「我休你們母親的休書在哪裡呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我把你們賣給了我哪一個債主呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們被賣是因為你們的罪惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的母親被休是因為你們的過犯。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為什麼我來的時候一個人也不在？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為什麼我呼喚的時候沒有人回答？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我的臂膀太短不能救贖你們嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我沒有能力拯救你們嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，我斥責一聲，海就乾了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使江河變為曠野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"魚類因無水而乾死，發出腥臭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使黑暗遮蔽諸天，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用麻布掩蓋天空。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["主僕的順服"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"主耶和華賜我受教者的舌頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我知道用什麼話幫助疲乏的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每天早晨，主喚醒我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫我像受教者那樣側耳聆聽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和華開了我的耳朵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我沒有悖逆，也沒有退縮。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人打我的背，我任他打；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人拔我的鬍子，我任他拔；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人侮辱我，朝我吐唾沬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不掩面。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我並不羞愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為主耶和華幫助我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我面如堅石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"知道自己必不會蒙羞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為我伸張正義的來了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰要控告我呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓我們來理論吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰是我的控告者呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓他到我這裡來吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，有主耶和華幫助我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能定我有罪呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，他們都要像衣服一樣漸漸破舊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被蛀蟲吃掉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["信靠上帝"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"你們中間誰敬畏耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聽從祂僕人的話？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行在黑暗中、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有光的人要信靠耶和華的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仰賴自己的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，你們自己點火、自備火把的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"靠自己點亮火光和燃起火把行走吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必落入悲慘的境地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華親手所定的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/50.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/51.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/49.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}